WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:02.940
<b>Taiyo Hinata</b>

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.440
<i>That was a lot harder 
than I thought it'd be.</i>

00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:12.900
<i>Which means she really is
 the successor of The Sun.</i>

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.900
<i>But now, this is the end.</i>

00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.990
We can open the 
Clessidra with this key, right?

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:28.490
<b>The Sun's Smile</b>

00:00:26.570 --> 00:00:28.500
But how?

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:34.460
If there is some change 
within the Clessidra,

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:36.850
the waves in the Astralux
 will move as well.

00:00:36.850 --> 00:00:38.510
That'll be your chance, meow.

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.140
We'll only have one chance to release her.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:44.330
We cannot be too early or too late.

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:47.880
Thanks for taking care of that.

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.520
What did they say?

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:53.650
There's no reason for them to refuse.

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.280
That's good to hear.

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:57.530
By making Akari-kun their avatar,

00:00:57.850 --> 00:01:01.670
the Daemonia will evolve from 
cells that can only divide

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:03.850
to having an existence of their own.

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:06.980
For them to try to escape 
the curse of the telomere

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:11.110
would be a rather far-fetched dream,
 don't you think, Laplace?

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:15.500
Are you suggesting that they 
are not allowed to even dream?

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:18.940
This should be enough.

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:49.840
Akari-san!

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:53.090
This isn't good! Hurry and 
wake up! You'll be absorbed!

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:55.090
Akari, wake up!

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:56.780
Akari!

00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:01.100
I was able to come back because of you!

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:05.180
I fought her in the other world, too.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:08.760
Forever and ever...

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:10.780
I thought it would never end.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:14.190
But then I heard your voice...

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:19.530
Ginka!

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:39.920
I was able to defeat her.

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:47.730
But if you're not 
around, there's no point!

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:50.490
I feel the same way!

00:02:50.490 --> 00:02:53.230
This time, it's our turn to save Akari.

00:02:53.530 --> 00:02:56.150
Come on, Akari! Wake up!

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:57.300
Akari!

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.210
Akari!

00:03:01.600 --> 00:03:02.950
Let's go.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:15.640
Akari?

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:22.440
Are you okay?

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:29.790
I'm sure that Auntie Hinata is 
watching over you from heaven.

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:32.270
Yeah...

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:37.910
<i>Fuyuna talked to me.</i>

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:47.120
<i>She looked at me for the first time.</i>

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:56.290
It's finally here.

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:59.670
Tonight will be the last.

00:04:00.780 --> 00:04:05.300
It'll end with you being unable 
to do anything, and I'll win.

00:04:05.650 --> 00:04:10.060
That may be, but I'll face Fuyuna
 head-on, without running away.

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.770
I don't care if you absorb me,

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:16.440
as long as I'm able to hear 
how Fuyuna really felt in the end.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:19.620
Wow. You're rather honest.

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:21.940
I'll be looking forward to it.

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:26.460
There's no way for two humans to
 understand each other anyway.

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:29.540
Come on, she's coming in.

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.460
Want to talk for a bit?

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:39.960
Yeah, I was thinking the same thing.

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:49.670
Fuyuna, do you hate me?

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.980
Have you always hated me?

00:04:55.980 --> 00:04:58.980
Well, how do you feel 
about me, Akari?

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:01.980
There are some things 
I don't like about you.

00:05:04.850 --> 00:05:08.410
You're really smart, and 
you know a lot of things,

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:12.320
but sometimes I think
 you over think things.

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:14.500
I feel like you should

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.500
stop showing off and just 
act the way you feel.

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:21.940
And I think you act upon
 how you feel too much.

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:24.000
You do what you want, 
without thinking about it,

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:26.010
and you step on 
other people's feelings.

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:29.360
I've always hated that about you.

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:33.290
But really, I've always loved you.

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:39.580
Why did I turn into this monster?

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:41.720
Fuyuna...

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:48.360
Someone said, if the sun is too bright,

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.900
just block out its light with your hand.

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:54.410
You were always so bright.

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.410
Bright like the sun, you never had

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:59.860
to decorate yourself, and you 
could still be friends with everyone.

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:03.110
When I thought that I 
might always be in your shadow,

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:05.490
a dark haze covered my heart.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:09.930
But being with you, my heart warmed up.

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:12.930
I wanted to be around that kindness.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:14.880
I always wanted to be close to you.

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:18.070
I'm sorry, Akari.

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:22.310
I blamed you for me 
not being able to try harder.

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:25.780
I've made you suffer so much. I...

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:28.030
In my selfishness, I...

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:32.640
I'm glad I got to hear how you really felt.

00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:35.540
I love you, too, Fuyuna.

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:38.040
Why?

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:41.950
That should be obvious!

00:06:41.950 --> 00:06:45.970
You were nice to me from
 the first time we met.

00:06:46.600 --> 00:06:52.620
You saved me after I lost
 my mom and was lonely. So...

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:55.020
Even if you become a Daemonia...

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:59.140
Your weaknesses, kindness, everything...

00:07:01.410 --> 00:07:04.060
I'm sorry... Help...

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:06.650
I couldn't do anything, 
even in the very end.

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:08.650
Fuyuna...

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:17.660
Please, Akari...

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:22.770
<i>If this is the fate I have to choose...</i>

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:25.980
<i>For Fuyuna's sake,</i>

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:27.400
<i>as well as my own,</i>

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:29.450
<i>I will accept this destiny!</i>

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:47.000
Bye-bye, Akari.

00:07:47.460 --> 00:07:50.430
Thank you for saying that you loved me.

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:54.330
I'm glad I met you, Akari.

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:57.250
Me too, Fuyuna.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:58.200
Impossible!

00:08:03.070 --> 00:08:05.710
Are you saying the darkness was purified?

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:08.290
There's no way you're that powerful!

00:08:08.290 --> 00:08:10.710
Not a mere human like you!

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:16.120
You're weak, ugly, undisciplined beings.

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:19.710
Understanding one another 
is only an illusion.

00:08:19.710 --> 00:08:21.230
And yet, why?!

00:08:21.610 --> 00:08:24.730
I don't think that we fully
 understood each other.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:30.100
But Fuyuna and I chose the 
path we both thought was right.

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:33.240
And I'm going to keep 
choosing my own path!

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:38.700
The idealism of humans, of tarot 
users, really is so disgusting.

00:08:41.770 --> 00:08:43.360
I guess there's no choice.

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:46.000
I'll just have to search for 
the next avatar again.

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:50.000
I'm rather disappointed that
 I wasn't able to obtain you.

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:53.010
I'll make sure I have fun killing you.

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:08.020
If you die, another road to victory
 for the Daemonia will open up.

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:10.770
The Elemental Tarot

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:14.030
will never be able to have all 22 again.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:27.290
Wh-What the...?

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:33.550
There's been a change 
in the waves of the Astralux!

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:36.300
The Clessidra is moving, meow.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:38.300
Now!

00:10:55.910 --> 00:10:57.630
Gavel of Judgment!

00:10:58.400 --> 00:10:59.880
Light of The World!

00:11:06.380 --> 00:11:07.390
Break through!

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:16.900
That light is...

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:51.850
Akari-san!

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:53.830
Akari-san!

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:57.320
Akari-san, are you all right?

00:11:58.340 --> 00:11:59.230
Akari!

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:02.270
Wake up, Akari! Akari!

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:05.460
Ginka?

00:12:06.520 --> 00:12:08.950
Hey, I came back.

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:10.990
Thank goodness.

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:12.960
You're all here.

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:15.460
We were able to come back
 because of you, Akari.

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:18.460
Thanks, Akari-san.

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:33.920
Then I'll just have to do this myself.

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:46.160
Did Akari understand your feelings?

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:49.010
You're going to save Akari even though

00:12:49.010 --> 00:12:51.460
she's the reason you 
turned into a Daemonia?

00:12:51.460 --> 00:12:55.250
Akari-san was not the reason.
 It was my weakness!

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:58.580
I might continue to be weak,

00:12:58.580 --> 00:13:02.130
but I won't run away from myself!

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:07.610
I'm surprised you were able to make it back.

00:13:07.610 --> 00:13:10.970
It's all thanks to you and
 Akari entering the Clessidra.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:13.070
Not to mention, after fighting 
the counterpart card,

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:14.890
I understand myself very well.

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:18.150
The counterpart card wasn't 
the card of destruction.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:20.610
It was the card of unification.

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.000
Ginka! Luna!

00:13:25.580 --> 00:13:28.630
What a farce. Are you 
all playing friends again?

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:31.910
Does this mean you've forgiven
 Luna's weakness as well?

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:35.660
There was no quarrel 
between us to begin with.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:37.970
And Luna isn't weak!

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:44.200
These are the souls that I've eaten.

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:47.930
Of all of the Daemonia
 filled with negativity.

00:13:48.630 --> 00:13:50.850
All of them are drawn to your blood.

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:53.930
Because half of you is one of us.

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:59.440
You rejecting these 
souls and defeating me

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:01.400
will change nothing in this world!

00:14:03.050 --> 00:14:06.710
Humans will always want to 
be the center of attention.

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:09.610
They're filled with hate, fear, and worry,

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:12.450
and will try to get rid of those 
who are different from them.

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:16.710
As long as those feelings exist,
 the Daemonia will never disappear!

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:19.080
That might be true.

00:14:19.440 --> 00:14:20.350
But!

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:21.710
I'm not going to give up!

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:27.450
Light and Shadow...

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:29.510
The ones who have both are humans.

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:32.300
There's no way to get rid
 of one or the other!

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:34.520
Foolish words!

00:14:37.310 --> 00:14:40.260
Even if they are surrounded by darkness,

00:14:40.260 --> 00:14:42.820
humans can try again
 as many times as they need to!

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:49.850
I may not be able to 
save the people who

00:14:49.850 --> 00:14:51.320
have turned into Daemonia right now.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:54.580
The world may never change, but...

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:58.530
I will find a way to save them
 one day, no matter what!

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:04.590
Do you think you can defy fate?

00:15:05.060 --> 00:15:07.160
We choose our own fate!

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:09.090
It's not something for you to decide!

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.100
Then I'll just have to make you obey.

00:15:24.130 --> 00:15:27.110
I won't let anything get in my 
way! Especially a human!

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:30.970
How are we going to do this?

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:32.610
I'm going for the head.

00:15:46.060 --> 00:15:47.880
Here I come!

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:10.250
I'm going to start with you after all.

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:12.910
I'm going to tear you apart!

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:16.720
What?!

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:24.210
Priscilla-san! Meltina-san!

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:27.160
Sorry we're late!

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:29.710
We're gonna help out, too!

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:32.660
Annoying little gnats!

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:38.930
Let's do this!

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:39.970
Roger!

00:16:41.480 --> 00:16:42.880
Take this!

00:17:05.030 --> 00:17:06.880
Priscilla-san! Meltina-san!

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:30.320
The thing Cerebrum is holding is The Sun?

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:32.320
It can't be...

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:35.220
Why?!

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:38.490
Why do you defy when
 you know there's no hope?!

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:43.330
The fate of you humans is insignificant!

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.330
Even if that's true...

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:48.370
<i>...we have no choice...</i>

00:17:48.370 --> 00:17:50.200
<i>...but to fight!</i>

00:17:51.140 --> 00:17:53.340
<i>Because we're all friends...</i>

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:55.820
<i>...who have the same tarot powers!</i>

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.800
<i>We will fight and defy!</i>

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:02.000
<i>And continue to choose our own fates!</i>

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:31.130
Is that... Could it be?

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:34.780
It's a card!

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:35.630
Akari!

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:37.130
Right!

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:10.920
Mom?

00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:43.720
<i>Humans...</i>

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:49.270
<i>You're such...</i>

00:19:56.470 --> 00:19:59.120
A Daemonia with free will, huh?

00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:02.430
If he had free will, I wonder 
if he had a soul, too.

00:20:10.670 --> 00:20:14.520
I couldn't hear a voice. Nothing.

00:20:22.500 --> 00:20:26.450
We've been sealed again. Talk about fast.

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:35.960
It's been forever since I've
 breathed the air out here!

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:39.960
Ginka, you sound like an old man.

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:45.470
The way you said that makes you 
sound like an old man, too, Seira-san.

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:47.890
Hey! Luna retorted.

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:50.930
I wonder if that means she's grown.

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:56.120
You've all been through quite a lot.

00:20:57.050 --> 00:20:58.360
Lot.

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:02.490
We'll check you all to
 make sure everything's okay.

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:06.320
Welcome back.

00:21:06.320 --> 00:21:08.990
I've chosen my path.

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:14.430
I'm going to keep fighting with everyone,

00:21:14.430 --> 00:21:16.900
so that one day I'll 
really be able to save

00:21:16.900 --> 00:21:19.750
those who have been 
possessed by the Daemonia.

00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:28.260
Thank you, Akari-san.

00:21:28.880 --> 00:21:32.020
Thank you, everyone. Well done.

00:21:34.690 --> 00:21:38.770
I'm very blessed to have
 friends like all of you.

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:56.290
So we're starting from 
the beginning again.

00:21:56.600 --> 00:21:58.300
Just a little more.

00:21:58.700 --> 00:22:00.510
It's exciting!

00:22:00.510 --> 00:22:01.550
Exciting!

00:22:07.860 --> 00:22:10.550
This may be an 
indiscreet way of saying it,

00:22:10.880 --> 00:22:14.560
but going to a new branch is exciting!

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:19.580
First Europe, then America, 
and then where else?

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:23.070
The Middle East, and Central and
 South America, I think.

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:26.070
I wonder what they're like.

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:32.080
Hey, I've never been overseas.
 What's customs like?

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:37.220
You show them your passport, 
and they stamp it, apparently.

00:22:37.220 --> 00:22:39.580
Wow, that's easier than I thought.

00:22:39.870 --> 00:22:41.760
Oh! My passport!

00:22:45.770 --> 00:22:46.660
Huh?

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:54.350
<i>Even if the Sun is hidden by a lone cloud,</i>

00:22:54.840 --> 00:22:59.680
<i>a single beam of light 
can chase away the darkness.</i>

00:23:00.490 --> 00:23:03.610
<i>That is the Sun's smile.</i>

00:23:09.160 --> 00:23:11.800
<i>Thank you, Fuyuna.</i>

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:43.230
<b>Thank You For Watching!</b>
